  vendorName: Archivist Alistair
  offerText: That sprawling collection of old encyclopedias is simply gathering dust,
    sir. Allow me to write you a check, and I will have my men clear them out post-haste.
  acceptResultText: Alistair hands you the money while his men haul out the massive
    books. Your bookshelves are empty, and you feel entirely unburdened.
  rejectResultText: You refuse. As you turn around, you snag your sleeve on a towering
    stack of books, sending them crashing onto your foot.
